Its Who What When Where Why How Which And But Or So Because If While Although
Though Unless Since Then In On At By For From To With Without As Of After
Before Under Over Into Through All Any Each Every Some Many More Most No None
One Both Other Another Is Are Was Were Be Do Does Did Can Could Will Would
Should Must May Might Have Has Had Cannot
'''.split())
